{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30393","headline":"山阳卢明府以双鹤寄遗白氏以诗回答因寄和 · 赵嘏","name":"山阳卢明府以双鹤寄遗白氏以诗回答因寄和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"缑山双去羽翰轻，应爲仙家好弟兄。\n茅固枕前秋对舞，陆云溪上夜同鸣。\n紫泥封处曾回首，碧落归时莫问程。\n自笑沧江一渔叟，何由似尔到层城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30393.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30393","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}